{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788239838424,"sessionID":"ses_fa4a24ca1ffeh7JKx4QpKQV4BC","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-b21a9fc4552cf14a","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"\"\"\"Curated registry of Brazilian soccer clubs.\n\nEvery raw team string found in the datasets is normalized (see\n``normalize.normalize_text``) and looked up against the alias index below.\nAliases cover the naming variants observed across the six Kaggle files:\n\n* state-suffixed forms ....... \"Palmeiras-SP\", \"Grêmio - RS\", \"Botafogo RJ\"\n* plain forms ................ \"Palmeiras\", \"Gremio\"\n* full/legal names .......... \"Atlético Mineiro\", \"Athletico Paranaense\",\n                              \"Sport Club do Recife\", \"América FC (Minas Gerais)\"\n\nBase names (\"flamengo\") are claimed by the *major* club only; smaller clubs\nsharing a name always carry their state (\"Flamengo-PI\" is a distinct club).\nForeign Libertadores clubs are not curated: they resolve through the\ngeneric fallback identity built by ``fallback_club``.\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom typing import Optional\n\nfrom .normalize import (\n    FOREIGN_COUNTRY_CODES,\n    normalize_text,\n    split_state_suffix,\n)\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass Club:\n    club_id: str\n    name: str  # display name (no state suffix)\n    state: Optional[str]  # Brazilian UF, or None for foreign clubs\n    country: str  # ISO-ish country code, \"BRA\" for Brazilian clubs\n    aliases: frozenset  # normalized keys, incl. state-suffixed variants\n    fifa_names: frozenset  # exact FIFA 'Club' column strings (FIFA 19)\n\n    @property\n    def display(self) -> str:\n        return f\"{self.name} ({self.state})\" if self.state else self.name\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass Derby:\n    name: str\n    club_a: str\n    club_b: str\n\n\ndef _club(club_id, name, state, aliases, fifa_names=()):\n    return Club(\n        club_id=club_id,\n        name=name,\n        state=state,\n        country=\"BRA\",\n        aliases=frozenset(aliases),\n        fifa_names=frozenset(fifa_names),\n    )\n\n\n_CLUBS = [\n    # --- Rio de Janeiro ---\n    _club(\"flamengo\", \"Flamengo\", \"RJ\",\n          [\"flamengo\", \"flamengo rj\", \"cr flamengo\"]),\n    _club(\"fluminense\", \"Fluminense\", \"RJ\", [\"fluminense\", \"fluminense rj\"]),\n    _club(\"vasco\", \"Vasco da Gama\", \"RJ\",\n          [\"vasco\", \"vasco rj\", \"vasco da gama\", \"vasco da gama rj\",\n           \"cr vasco da gama\"]),\n    _club(\"botafogo_rj\", \"Botafogo\", \"RJ\",\n          [\"botafogo\", \"botafogo rj\", \"botafogo de futebol e regatas\"],\n          fifa_names=[\"Botafogo\"]),\n    # --- São Paulo ---\n    _club(\"corinthians\", \"Corinthians\", \"SP\",\n          [\"corinthians\", \"corinthians sp\", \"sport club corinthians paulista\"]),\n    _club(\"palmeiras\", \"Palmeiras\", \"SP\",\n          [\"palmeiras\", \"palmeiras sp\", \"se palmeiras\"]),\n    _club(\"sao_paulo\", \"São Paulo\", \"SP\",\n          [\"sao paulo\", \"sao paulo sp\", \"sao paulo fc\"]),\n    _club(\"santos\", \"Santos\", \"SP\",\n          [\"santos\", \"santos sp\", \"santos fc\"], fifa_names=[\"Santos\"]),\n    _club(\"ponte_preta\", \"Ponte Preta\", \"SP\",\n          [\"ponte preta\", \"ponte preta sp\"]),\n    _club(\"portuguesa\", \"Portuguesa\", \"SP\",\n          [\"portuguesa\", \"portuguesa sp\", \"portuguesa desportos\"]),\n    _club(\"bragantino\", \"Red Bull Bragantino\", \"SP\",\n          [\"bragantino\", \"red bull bragantino\", \"red bull bragantino sp\",\n           \"rb bragantino\"]),\n    _club(\"guarani\", \"Guarani\", \"SP\", [\"guarani\", \"guarani sp\"]),\n    _club(\"ituano\", \"Ituano\", \"SP\", [\"ituano\", \"ituano sp\"]),\n    _club(\"oeste\", \"Oeste\", \"SP\", [\"oeste\", \"oeste sp\"]),\n    _club(\"santo_andre\", \"Santo André\", \"SP\", [\"santo andre\", \"santo andre sp\"]),\n    # --- Minas Gerais ---\n    _club(\"atletico_mg\", \"Atlético Mineiro\", \"MG\",\n          [\"atletico mg\", \"atletico mineiro\", \"clube atletico mineiro\"],\n          fifa_names=[\"Atlético Mineiro\"]),\n    _club(\"cruzeiro\", \"Cruzeiro\", \"MG\",\n          [\"cruzeiro\", \"cruzeiro mg\"], fifa_names=[\"Cruzeiro\"]),\n    _club(\"america_mg\", \"América Mineiro\", \"MG\",\n          [\"america mg\", \"america mineiro\", \"america fc minas gerais\",\n           \"america fc mg\"], fifa_names=[\"América FC (Minas Gerais)\"]),\n    # --- Rio Grande do Sul ---\n    _club(\"gremio\", \"Grêmio\", \"RS\",\n          [\"gremio\", \"gremio rs\"], fifa_names=[\"Grêmio\"]),\n    _club(\"internacional\", \"Internacional\", \"RS\",\n          [\"internacional\", \"internacional rs\", \"sc internacional\"],\n          fifa_names=[\"Internacional\"]),\n    _club(\"juventude\", \"Juventude\", \"RS\",\n          [\"juventude\", \"juventude rs\", \"ec juventude\"]),\n    # --- Paraná ---\n    _club(\"atletico_pr\", \"Athletico Paranaense\", \"PR\",\n          [\"atletico pr\", \"athletico pr\", \"atletico paranaense\",\n           \"athletico paranaense\", \"athletico\"],\n          fifa_names=[\"Atlético Paranaense\"]),\n    _club(\"coritiba\", \"Coritiba\", \"PR\", [\"coritiba\", \"coritiba pr\"]),\n    _club(\"parana\", \"Paraná\", \"PR\",\n          [\"parana\", \"parana pr\", \"parana clube\"], fifa_names=[\"Paraná\"]),\n    _club(\"londrina\", \"Londrina\", \"PR\", [\"londrina\", \"londrina pr\"]),\n    _club(\"operario_pr\", \"Operário-PR\", \"PR\",\n          [\"operario pr\", \"operario ferroviario\"]),\n    # --- Santa Catarina ---\n    _club(\"avai\", \"Avaí\", \"SC\", [\"avai\", \"avai sc\"]),\n    _club(\"chapecoense\", \"Chapecoense\", \"SC\",\n          [\"chapecoense\", \"chapecoense sc\"], fifa_names=[\"Chapecoense\"]),\n    _club(\"criciuma\", \"Criciúma\", \"SC\", [\"criciuma\", \"criciuma sc\"]),\n    _club(\"figueirense\", \"Figueirense\", \"SC\", [\"figueirense\", \"figueirense sc\"]),\n    _club(\"joinville\", \"Joinville\", \"SC\", [\"joinville\", \"joinville sc\"]),\n    _club(\"brusque\", \"Brusque\", \"SC\", [\"brusque\", \"brusque sc\"]),\n    # --- Bahia ---\n    _club(\"bahia\", \"Bahia\", \"BA\",\n          [\"bahia\", \"bahia ba\", \"ec bahia\", \"esporte clube bahia\"],\n          fifa_names=[\"Bahia\"]),\n    _club(\"vitoria\", \"Vitória\", \"BA\",\n          [\"vitoria\", \"vitoria ba\", \"ec vitoria\", \"esporte clube vitoria\"],\n          fifa_names=[\"Vitória\"]),\n    _club(\"bahia_de_feira\", \"Bahia de Feira\", \"BA\",\n          [\"bahia de feira\", \"bahia de feira ba\"]),\n    _club(\"vitoria_da_conquista\", \"Vitória da Conquista\", \"BA\",\n          [\"vitoria da conquista\", \"vitoria da conquista ba\"]),\n    # --- Pernambuco ---\n    _club(\"sport\", \"Sport\", \"PE\",\n          [\"sport\", \"sport pe\", \"sport recife\", \"sport club recife\",\n           \"sport club do recife\"], fifa_names=[\"Sport Club do Recife\"]),\n    _club(\"nautico\", \"Náutico\", \"PE\",\n          [\"nautico\", \"nautico pe\", \"nautico capibaribe\"]),\n    _club(\"santa_cruz\", \"Santa Cruz\", \"PE\",\n          [\"santa cruz\", \"santa cruz pe\", \"santa cruz fc\"]),\n    # --- Ceará ---\n    _club(\"ceara\", \"Ceará\", \"CE\",\n          [\"ceara\", \"ceara ce\", \"ceara sporting club\", \"ceara sc\"],\n          fifa_names=[\"Ceará Sporting Club\"]),\n    _club(\"fortaleza\", \"Fortaleza\", \"CE\",\n          [\"fortaleza\", \"fortaleza ce\", \"fortaleza ec\", \"fortaleza fc\"]),\n    # --- Goiás / Centro-Oeste ---\n    _club(\"goias\", \"Goiás\", \"GO\", [\"goias\", \"goias go\", \"goias ec\"]),\n    _club(\"atletico_go\", \"Atlético Goianiense\", \"GO\",\n          [\"atletico go\", \"atletico goianiense\"]),\n    _club(\"vila_nova\", \"Vila Nova\", \"GO\", [\"vila nova\", \"vila nova go\"]),\n    _club(\"cuiaba\", \"Cuiabá\", \"MT\", [\"cuiaba\", \"cuiaba mt\", \"cuiaba ec\"]),\n    _club(\"brasiliense\", \"Brasiliense\", \"DF\", [\"brasiliense\", \"brasiliense df\"]),\n    # --- North / Northeast ---\n    _club(\"paysandu\", \"Paysandu\", \"PA\", [\"paysandu\", \"paysandu pa\"]),\n    _club(\"remo\", \"Remo\", \"PA\", [\"remo\", \"remo pa\", \"clube do remo\"]),\n    _club(\"csa\", \"CSA\", \"AL\", [\"csa\", \"csa al\"]),\n    _club(\"asa\", \"ASA\", \"AL\", [\"asa\", \"asa al\"]),\n    _club(\"crb\", \"CRB\", \"AL\", [\"crb\", \"crb al\"]),\n    _club(\"abc\", \"ABC\", \"RN\", [\"abc\", \"abc rn\"]),\n    _club(\"america_rn\", \"América-RN\", \"RN\",\n          [\"america rn\", \"america de natal\", \"america fc natal\"]),\n    _club(\"sampaio_correa\", \"Sampaio Corrêa\", \"MA\",\n          [\"sampaio correa\", \"sampaio correa ma\"]),\n    _club(\"confianca\", \"Confiança\", \"SE\",\n          [\"confianca\", \"confianca se\", \"ad confianca\"]),\n    _club(\"nacional_am\", \"Nacional-AM\", \"AM\", [\"nacional am\"]),\n    _club(\"atletico_ac\", \"Atlético Acreano\", \"AC\",\n          [\"atletico ac\", \"atletico acreano\"]),\n    _club(\"atletico_alagoinhas\", \"Atlético de Alagoinhas\", \"BA\",\n          [\"atletico ba\", \"atletico alagoinhas\"]),\n    _club(\"atletico_cearense\", \"Atlético Cearense\", \"CE\",\n          [\"atletico cearense\", \"fc atletico cearense\"]),\n    # --- same-name smaller clubs (must not fall through to major clubs) ---\n    _club(\"flamengo_pi\", \"Flamengo-PI\", \"PI\",\n          [\"flamengo pi\", \"flamengo do piaui\", \"flamengo do piaui pi\"]),\n    _club(\"fluminense_pi\", \"Fluminense-PI\", \"PI\", [\"fluminense pi\"]),\n    _club(\"fluminense_de_feira\", \"Fluminense de Feira\", \"BA\",\n          [\"fluminense de feira\", \"fluminense de feira ba\"]),\n    _club(\"internacional_sc\", \"Internacional-SC\", \"SC\",\n          [\"internacional sc\", \"ec internacional sc\"]),\n    _club(\"botafogo_pb\", \"Botafogo-PB\", \"PB\", [\"botafogo pb\"]),\n    _club(\"botafogo_sp\", \"Botafogo-SP\", \"SP\", [\"botafogo sp\"]),\n    _club(\"bragantino_pa\", \"Bragantino-PA\", \"PA\", [\"bragantino pa\"]),\n    _club(\"boavista_rj\", \"Boavista\", \"RJ\",\n          [\"boavista\", \"boavista rj\", \"boavista sport club\",\n           \"boavista sport club antigo esporte clube barreira\",\n           \"boavista sport club antigo esporte clube barreira rj\"]),\n    _club(\"macae\", \"Macae\", \"RJ\", [\"macae\", \"macae esporte fc\", \"macae esporte rj\"]),\n    _club(\"campinense\", \"Campinense\", \"PB\",\n          [\"campinense\", \"campinense clube\"]),\n    _club(\"tombense\", \"Tombense\", \"MG\", [\"tombense\", \"tombense mg\"]),\n    _club(\"tupi_mg\", \"Tupi\", \"MG\", [\"tupi\", \"tupi mg\"]),\n    _club(\"ypiranga_rs\", \"Ypiranga\", \"RS\", [\"ypiranga\", \"ypiranga rs\"]),\n]\n\nCLUBS: dict[str, Club] = {c.club_id: c for c in _CLUBS}\n\n# alias key -> club_id (aliases include state-suffixed variants)\nALIAS_INDEX: dict[str, str] = {\n    alias: club.club_id for club in _CLUBS for alias in club.aliases\n}\nassert len(ALIAS_INDEX) == sum(len(c.aliases) for c in _CLUBS), \"alias collision\"\n\n# exact FIFA club string -> canonical club id\nFIFA_CLUB_INDEX: dict[str, str] = {\n    fifa_name: club.club_id for club in _CLUBS for fifa_name in club.fifa_names\n}\n\n# --- Brazilian derbies (traditional rivalries) -------------------------------\nDERBIES = [\n    Derby(\"Fla-Flu\", \"flamengo\", \"fluminense\"),\n    Derby(\"Clássico dos Milhões\", \"flamengo\", \"vasco\"),\n    Derby(\"Clássico Vovô\", \"botafogo_rj\", \"fluminense\"),\n    Derby(\"Grenal\", \"gremio\", \"internacional\"),\n    Derby(\"Clássico Majestoso\", \"corinthians\", \"sao_paulo\"),\n    Derby(\"Derby Paulista\", \"corinthians\", \"palmeiras\"),\n    Derby(\"Choque-Rei\", \"palmeiras\", \"sao_paulo\"),\n    Derby(\"San-São\", \"santos\", \"sao_paulo\"),\n    Derby(\"Clássico da Saudade\", \"palmeiras\", \"santos\"),\n    Derby(\"Ba-Vi\", \"bahia\", \"vitoria\"),\n    Derby(\"Clássico-Rei (Minas Gerais)\", \"atletico_mg\", \"cruzeiro\"),\n    Derby(\"Atletiba\", \"atletico_pr\", \"coritiba\"),\n    Derby(\"Clássico-Rei (Ceará)\", \"ceara\", \"fortaleza\"),\n]\n\n\ndef resolve_club(query: str) -> Optional[Club]:\n    \"\"\"Resolve a raw/user string to a curated club, or None.\n\n    Tier 1: exact normalized alias (\"flamengo rj\", \"atletico mineiro\").\n    Tier 2: strip a trailing Brazilian UF, then re-check the alias index,\n            accepting only when the UF matches the club's own state. This\n            lets \"Flamengo RJ\" resolve while \"Flamengo-PI\" stays distinct.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not query or not query.strip():\n        return None\n    key = normalize_text(query)\n    if not key:\n        return None\n    club_id = ALIAS_INDEX.get(key)\n    if club_id:\n        return CLUBS[club_id]\n    base, uf = split_state_suffix(key)\n    if base != key and uf:\n        club_id = ALIAS_INDEX.get(base)\n        if club_id and CLUBS[club_id].state == uf:\n            return CLUBS[club_id]\n    return None\n\n\ndef fallback_club(raw_name: str) -> Club:\n    \"\"\"Build a synthetic Club identity for names outside the registry.\n\n    Used for foreign Libertadores clubs (\"Boca Juniors\", \"River Plate\")\n    and small Brazilian clubs not curated above. The identity key keeps\n    parenthetical qualifiers (\"Nacional (URU)\" vs \"Nacional (PAR)\") so\n    same-named clubs stay distinct.\n    \"\"\"\n    key = normalize_text(raw_name)\n    _base, uf = split_state_suffix(key)\n    tokens = key.split()\n    country = \"BRA\"\n    if not uf and len(tokens) >= 2 and tokens[-1].upper() in FOREIGN_COUNTRY_CODES:\n        country = FOREIGN_COUNTRY_CODES[tokens[-1].upper()]\n    elif not uf:\n        country = \"INT\"\n    return Club(\n        club_id=f\"x_{key.replace(' ', '_')}\",\n        name=raw_name.strip(),\n        state=uf,\n        country=country,\n        aliases=frozenset({key}),\n        fifa_names=frozenset(),\n    )\n","filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-x26yewvv/retort-8c2c162e81b7/soccer_mcp/clubs.py"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-x26yewvv/retort-8c2c162e81b7/soccer_mcp/clubs.py","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"soccer_mcp/clubs.py","time":{"start":1788239838414,"end":1788239838422}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Wait — there's an issue with `resolve_club` tier 3 (containment). For query \"flamengo pi\": tier 1 fails (\"flamengo pi\" not in aliases... wait, actually \"flamengo pi\" IS not an alias — good). Tier 2: split_state_suffix(\"flamengo pi\") → base \"flamengo\", uf PI → BASE_INDEX[\"flamengo\"] → flamengo! That's wrong — \"Flamengo-PI\" should be Flamengo do Piauí, not Flamengo RJ!\n\nHmm. Tier 2 strips the UF and matches the base — but the base is owned by the major club. For raw data \"Flamengo - PI\" (Cup file, 2 matches), tier 2 would map it to the big Flamengo. That's incorrect.\n\nI need to handle this: the base-name claim should only apply when the stripped UF matches the club's OWN state or is absent. I.e., tier 2: strip UF from query → base; match base only if the club that owns the base has the same UF as the query's, OR query has no UF.\n\nWait more precisely:\n- query \"flamengo rj\" (UF RJ): strip → base \"flamengo\" owned by flamengo (RJ). Since flamengo's state == RJ ✓ → match.\n- query \"flamengo pi\" (UF PI): base \"flamengo\" owned by flamengo (RJ) but query UF PI ≠ RJ → NO match → falls to tier 3 containment → containment check: is any alias contained in \"flamengo pi\"? \"flamengo\" IS contained in \"flamengo pi\"! Tier 3 would also match flamengo. Ugh.\n\nTier 3 containment needs to be word-boundary aware and state-aware too. The containment case exists for things like \"clube atletico mineiro\" containing alias \"clube atletico mineiro\" (exact anyway). What real cases need containment?\n- \"vasco da gama rj\" — is it an alias? Yes, curated. \n- \"atletico goianiense\" — curated.\n- What about \"Sport Club do Recife\" vs query \"Sport Club Recife\"? Curated both.\n- FIFA names are exact strings, matched separately.\n- The containment tier mainly serves user queries like \"CR Flamengo de Rio e Janeiro\"? Rare.\n\nSimplest fix: in tier 3, require the alias match to be a full-key match OR alias == key minus trailing UF... Actually let me reconsider: the real-world user queries will be like \"Flamengo\", \"VASCO\", \"palmeiras\". Tier 1 handles those. The state-aware tier 2 handles \"Flamengo RJ\". The dangerous case is \"Flamengo-PI\" → I want it to NOT match big Flamengo and become its own fallback identity \"flamengo pi\" → club id \"x_flamengo_pi\". \n\nFor tier 3 containment, I'll require that the key STARTS WITH the alias AND the remainder is either empty or the remainder tokens contain a UF/state token. And when the remainder is a UF, it must equal the club's state. Hmm, this is getting complex. Alternative: drop tier 3 entirely and add explicit curated aliases for the actual observed variants (which I've already done comprehensively from my data exploration). For user-typo tolerance, I'll add a fuzzy search in the ENGINE's resolve (returns candidates list) rather than in the registry's resolve_club. That's cleaner:\n\n- `resolve_club(query)`: tier 1 exact alias; tier 2 base+state-aware; that's it. Everything else → None → fallback identity.\n- Engine's `resolve_team` for user queries: try resolve_club; if None, search all known clubs (curated + observed-from-data) by substring/prefix, return ranked candidates.\n\nAnd the raw-data loader: raw name → resolve_club() → if None, fallback_club() and REMEMBER the observed identity (so \"Flamengo - PI\" and \"Flamengo do Piauí - PI\" — hmm those are 2 different strings in the Cup file: 'Flamengo - PI' (2) and 'Flamengo do Piauí - PI' (2). As fallbacks they'd be different identities: \"flamengo pi\" and \"flamengo do piaui pi\". 4 matches total for a tiny club — acceptable imperfection. \n\nActually wait — can I curate flamengo_pi too? Yes: add club \"flamengo_pi\" Flamengo-PI PI aliases {\"flamengo pi\", \"flamengo do piaui\", \"flamengo do piaui pi\"}. Similarly other \"-PI/BA/...\" variants of big names in the Cup file: \"Fluminense de Feira - BA\" (fluminense_de_feira), \"Fluminense PI\" (fluminense_pi? key \"fluminense pi\"). Let me curate those tiny ones too for correctness:\n- flamengo_pi: aliases \"flamengo pi\", \"flamengo do piaui\", \"flamengo do piaui pi\"\n- fluminense_de_feira: \"fluminense de feira\", \"fluminense de feira ba\"\n- fluminense_pi: \"fluminense pi\"\n- vitoria_da_conquista: \"vitoria da conquista\", \"vitoria da conquista ba\"\n- bahia_de_feira: \"bahia de feira\", \"bahia de feira ba\"\n- internacional_sc: \"internacional sc\", \"ec internacional sc\"\n- bragantino_pa: \"bragantino pa\"\n- atletico_ac? \"Atlético - AC\" (2 in Cup) → hmm \"atletico acreano\"? That's Atlético Acreano (AC). Cup has \"Atlético - AC\" (2) and BR-Football \"Atletico Acreano\" (41). Same club? Atlético-AC in Copa do Brasil 2012-2014 era... Atlético Acreano yes. Curate \"atletico_ac\": aliases \"atletico ac\", \"atletico acreano\". \n- \"Atletico - ES\" (1 Cup) → atletico_es fallback (Desportiva? no, Atlético-ES doesn't exist... it's \"Atlético Esporte Clube\" hmm). Fallback.\n- \"Atlético - BA\" (2 Cup) → Atlético de Alagoinhas (BA)! BR-Football has \"Atletico Alagoinhas\" (4). Curate \"atletico_alagoinhas\": {\"atletico ba\"?? hmm — \"Atlético - BA\" key = \"atletico ba\"; \"Atletico Alagoinhas\" key = \"atletico alagoinhas\"}. Aliases: \"atletico ba\", \"atletico alagoinhas\". OK.\n- \"Atletico Cearense\"/\"FC Atlético Cearense\"/\"Atlético Cearense - CE\" → atletico_cearense: {\"atletico cearense\", \"fc atletico cearense\"}.\n- \"Boavista - RJ\"/\"Boavista RJ\"/\"Boavista Sport Club (antigo...)\" → boavista_rj: {\"boavista\", \"boavista rj\", \"boavista sport club\", \"boavista sport club antigo esporte clube barreira\", \"boavista sport club antigo esporte clube barreira rj\"}. Eh — the \"(antigo...)\" one: normalize_text keeps paren content: \"boavista sport club antigo esporte clube barreira rj\". I'll include that full alias. \n\nHmm — am I over-curating? The success criterion is \"Handles team name variations correctly\" and the tests focus on major clubs. But cross-file consistency matters for stats. Let me add these small clubs — it's cheap. But I must be careful NOT to let small clubs break major-club matching: e.g. \"boavista\" bare alias — only Boavista-RJ uses it. Fine.\n\nAlso from BR-Football more unification opportunities (same club, different strings within the same file): \"Botafogo RJ\" vs \"Botafogo RJ\" — same. \"Fortaleza EC\" vs \"Fortaleza FC\" vs \"Ceara\" — curated ✓. \"Nautico Capibaribe\" ✓. \"Sao Jose PA\" vs \"Sao Jose RS\" vs \"Sao Jose - POA\" — different clubs, fallback fine. \"Macae Esporte FC\" vs \"Macae Esporte RJ\" — same club (Macae-RJ) → curate macae: {\"macae esporte fc\", \"macae esporte rj\", \"macae\"}. Eh, small. I'll add it.\n\n\"Campinense\" vs \"Campinense Clube\" → campinense: {\"campinense\", \"campinense clube\"}. \"Tombense\" vs \"Tombense MG\" → tombense {\"tombense\", \"tombense mg\"}. \"Tupi\" vs \"Tupi MG\" → tupi_mg {\"tupi\", \"tupi mg\"}. \"URT\" vs \"URT MG\" → urt {\"urt\", \"urt mg\"}. \"Ypiranga\" vs \"Ypiranga RS\" vs \"Ypiranga AP\" — Ypiranga-RS (Erechim) is the main: {\"ypiranga rs\", \"ypiranga\"}? \"Ypiranga\" bare (18) in BR-Football vs \"Ypiranga RS\" (153) vs Cup \"Ypiranga - RS\" (11) — same club (Ypiranga de Erechim). Curate ypiranga_rs: {\"ypiranga\", \"ypiranga rs\"}. Ypiranga-AP separate fallback.\n\nOK this is a long tail. Decision: curate the majors well + the specific cross-file variants I identified for clubs appearing in ≥2 files with different spellings. Small single-file clubs just pass through fallback. That satisfies the spec (major clubs match across all files; the example queries all involve major clubs).\n\nOne more important case: the state-aware tier-2 logic. Let me rewrite resolve_club:\n\n```python\ndef resolve_club(query):\n    key = normalize_text(query)\n    club_id = ALIAS_INDEX.get(key)          # tier 1 exact\n    if club_id: return CLUBS[club_id]\n    base, uf = split_state_suffix(key)      # tier 2 state-aware\n    if base != key:\n        cid = ALIAS_INDEX.get(base)\n        if cid and (CLUBS[cid].state == uf or CLUBS[cid].state is None):\n            return CLUBS[cid]\n    return None\n```\n\n- \"flamengo rj\": tier1 ✓ (curated alias)\n- \"flamengo pi\": tier1 ✗; tier2: base \"flamengo\" → flamengo (RJ), uf=PI ≠ RJ ✗ → None → fallback \"flamengo pi\" ✓ (and I'll curate flamengo_pi so it's registry-known)\n- \"santos laguna\": tier1 ✗; tier2: base \"santos laguna\" (no trailing UF — LAGUNA isn't UF) ✗ → fallback ✓ \n- \"atletico nacional\" (foreign): tier1 ✗ (not curated), tier2 no UF → fallback ✓\n- \"america fc natal\": tier1 ✓ (curated for america_rn)\n- \"gremio barueri\"? fallback ✓\n- \"Botafogo PB\": tier1 ✓ (curated botafogo_pb — wait, I didn't add botafogo_pb/botafogo_sp! Let me add them.)\n\nAdd: botafogo_pb {\"botafogo pb\"}, botafogo_sp {\"botafogo sp\"}.\n\nAlso the BASE_INDEX is now unused in the state-aware tier-2 — remove it? It was meant for claiming bases. With tier-2 restricted, \"flamengo\" (no UF) resolves via tier 1 alias directly (\"flamengo\" is an alias). BASE_INDEX becomes unnecessary. Remove it to keep things simple. Wait — do I still need it? Query \"Flamengo\" → tier1: alias \"flamengo\" exists ✓. Query \"Atletico-PR\" → tier1: \"atletico pr\" ✓ curated. Query \"Athletico-PR\" → \"athletico pr\" ✓. Query \"CA Parana\"? → tier1 ✗, tier2 no UF... wait \"ca parana\" has no trailing UF → None → fallback. Fine (deliberate: ambiguous).\n\nHmm — one more: tier 2's `CLUBS[cid].state is None` condition — foreign fallback clubs have state None; but curated Brazilian clubs always have a state. So condition simply `== uf`. But what about \"vasco da gama\" query → tier1 ✓.\n\nWhat about \"Barcelona-EQU\"? → tier1 ✗; tier2: split_state_suffix(\"barcelona equ\") — \"equ\" not in UFs (3 letters) → base == key → skip → fallback with country ECU ✓.\n\nWhat about \"Guaraní (PAR)\" → \"guarani par\" → tier2: \"par\" not a UF ✓ (PAR is 3 letters) → fallback \"guarani par\" ✓ distinct from Brazilian \"Guarani\" ✓.\n\nWhat about Brazilian clubs in Libertadores spelled bare: \"Flamengo\" → tier1 ✓. \"Vasco\" ✓. \"Botafogo\" ✓. \"São Paulo\" ✓. \"Palmeiras\" ✓. \n\nEdge: \"Grêmio Barueri - SP\" → \"gremio barueri sp\" → tier1 ✗; tier2: base \"gremio barueri\", uf SP; ALIAS_INDEX has no \"gremio barueri\" → None → fallback ✓ distinct from Grêmio ✓.\n\nEdge: \"Grêmio Prudente\" → fallback ✓ (was Palmeiras' name in 2010-2011! Real fact: Grêmio Prudente was actually Palmeiras playing under a sponsorship name in 2010. Hmm! But as a data-consumer I shouldn't fuse them. Keep fallback.)\n\nNow — the containment tier removal means user query \"CR Flamengo\" → tier1 \"cr flamengo\" ✓ curated. \"Sport Club Corinthians Paulista\" ✓ curated. OK good.\n\nNow, engine's user-facing team resolution adds fuzzy candidate search over a known-clubs universe (curated + all observed identities), so \"palmeirass\" typo returns near-matches list. I'll implement prefix/substring search with popularity ranking.\n\nAlso FIFA club matching: FIFA strings matched EXACTLY against fifa_names (e.g. \"Grêmio\"). But also — for user query \"players at Grêmio\": engine resolves club gremio, then looks up fifa_names {\"Grêmio\"} among players' raw club strings. Exact match on raw FIFA string. ✓. And \"América FC (Minas Gerais)\" → america_mg ✓.\n\nLet me now update clubs.py with the fixes:\n1. State-aware tier 2, remove BASE_INDEX and containment tier.\n2. Add missing clubs: botafogo_pb, botafogo_sp, flamengo_pi, fluminense_pi, fluminense_de_feira, vitoria_da_conquista, bahia_de_feira, internacional_sc, bragantino_pa, atletico_ac (atletico acreano), atletico_alagoinhas, atletico_cearense, boavista_rj, macae, campinense, tombense, tupi_mg, ypiranga_rs, volta_redonda? (BR-Football \"Volta Redonda\" 146 — single file, skip), ferreira? skip. sao_bento? skip. sao_bernardo? skip. mirassol? skip. londrina done. cuiaba done. parauapebas? skip.\n\nHmm also \"Vitoria F. C. - ES\" → key \"vitoria f c es\" — fallback (it's actually a Portuguese club? Vitória F.C. = Vitória de Setúbal? But \"- ES\"... Espírito Santo. Vitória-ES exists as \"Vitória Futebol Clube\"? Hmm, actually I don't think so. There's \"Rio Branco-ES\", \"Portuguesa-ES\"... \"Vitoria F. C. - ES\" appears in Cup 2012 once. Fallback, fine.)\n\n3. Sanity: alias collisions — let me make sure no alias is claimed by two clubs (\"vitoria\" only vitoria BA; \"vitoria es\"? not curated — good).\n\nI'll rewrite clubs.py now with these additions.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05b663ab5001p1YogW0qxs8lvH","sessionID":"ses_fa4a24ca1ffeh7JKx4QpKQV4BC","messageID":"msg_05b659c0c001VSLlgpPN2gLU8H"}}
