{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788240194099,"sessionID":"ses_fa4a24ca1ffeh7JKx4QpKQV4BC","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-aa674129b0d95dda","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-x26yewvv/retort-8c2c162e81b7/soccer_mcp/engine.py","newString":"_FAMILY_MATCHES = {\n    \"serie a\": SERIE_A,\n    \"serie b\": SERIE_B,\n    \"serie c\": SERIE_C,\n    \"copa do brasil\": COPA_DO_BRASIL,\n    \"libertadores\": LIBERTADORES,\n    \"brasileirao\": SERIE_A,\n    \"brasileirao serie a\": SERIE_A,\n    \"brasileirao serie b\": SERIE_B,\n    \"brasileirao serie c\": SERIE_C,\n    \"brazilian cup\": COPA_DO_BRASIL,\n    \"campeonato brasileiro\": SERIE_A,\n    \"serie a brasileirao\": SERIE_A,\n}\nLEAGUE_FAMILIES = frozenset({SERIE_A, SERIE_B, SERIE_C})\n\n# Authoritative file per competition family. For a season covered by one of\n# these files, its fixtures define the fixture set; rows from other files\n# describing the same pairing (BR-Football dates are often shifted by a day)\n# are merged in, and rows describing pairings the authoritative file does not\n# have (mislabelled BR-Football rows) are dropped.\nPREFERRED_SOURCES = {\n    SERIE_A: (\"Brasileirao_Matches.csv\", \"novo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv\"),\n    COPA_DO_BRASIL: (\"Brazilian_Cup_Matches.csv\",),\n    LIBERTADORES: (\"Libertadores_Matches.csv\",),\n}","oldString":"_FAMILY_MATCHES = {\n    \"serie a\": SERIE_A,\n    \"serie b\": SERIE_B,\n    \"serie c\": SERIE_C,\n    \"copa do brasil\": COPA_DO_BRASIL,\n    \"libertadores\": LIBERTADORES,\n    \"brasileirao\": SERIE_A,\n    \"brasileirao serie a\": SERIE_A,\n    \"brasileirao serie b\": SERIE_B,\n    \"brasileirao serie c\": SERIE_C,\n    \"brazilian cup\": COPA_DO_BRASIL,\n    \"campeonato brasileiro\": SERIE_A,\n    \"serie a brasileirao\": SERIE_A,\n}\nLEAGUE_FAMILIES = frozenset({SERIE_A, SERIE_B, SERIE_C})"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-x26yewvv/retort-8c2c162e81b7/soccer_mcp/engine.py\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-x26yewvv/retort-8c2c162e81b7/soccer_mcp/engine.py\n+++ /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-x26yewvv/retort-8c2c162e81b7/soccer_mcp/engine.py\n@@ -58,9 +58,20 @@\n     \"serie a brasileirao\": SERIE_A,\n }\n LEAGUE_FAMILIES = frozenset({SERIE_A, SERIE_B, SERIE_C})\n \n+# Authoritative file per competition family. For a season covered by one of\n+# these files, its fixtures define the fixture set; rows from other files\n+# describing the same pairing (BR-Football dates are often shifted by a day)\n+# are merged in, and rows describing pairings the authoritative file does not\n+# have (mislabelled BR-Football rows) are dropped.\n+PREFERRED_SOURCES = {\n+    SERIE_A: (\"Brasileirao_Matches.csv\", \"novo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv\"),\n+    COPA_DO_BRASIL: (\"Brazilian_Cup_Matches.csv\",),\n+    LIBERTADORES: (\"Libertadores_Matches.csv\",),\n+}\n \n+\n def _resolve_family(competition: Optional[str]) -> Optional[str]:\n     if not competition:\n         return None\n     return _FAMILY_MATCHES.get(normalize_text(competition))\n","filediff":{"file":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-x26yewvv/retort-8c2c162e81b7/soccer_mcp/engine.py","patch":"Index: /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-x26yewvv/retort-8c2c162e81b7/soccer_mcp/engine.py\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-x26yewvv/retort-8c2c162e81b7/soccer_mcp/engine.py\n+++ /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-x26yewvv/retort-8c2c162e81b7/soccer_mcp/engine.py\n@@ -58,9 +58,20 @@\n     \"serie a brasileirao\": SERIE_A,\n }\n LEAGUE_FAMILIES = frozenset({SERIE_A, SERIE_B, SERIE_C})\n \n+# Authoritative file per competition family. For a season covered by one of\n+# these files, its fixtures define the fixture set; rows from other files\n+# describing the same pairing (BR-Football dates are often shifted by a day)\n+# are merged in, and rows describing pairings the authoritative file does not\n+# have (mislabelled BR-Football rows) are dropped.\n+PREFERRED_SOURCES = {\n+    SERIE_A: (\"Brasileirao_Matches.csv\", \"novo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv\"),\n+    COPA_DO_BRASIL: (\"Brazilian_Cup_Matches.csv\",),\n+    LIBERTADORES: (\"Libertadores_Matches.csv\",),\n+}\n \n+\n def _resolve_family(competition: Optional[str]) -> Optional[str]:\n     if not competition:\n         return None\n     return _FAMILY_MATCHES.get(normalize_text(competition))\n","additions":11,"deletions":0},"truncated":false},"title":"soccer_mcp/engine.py","time":{"start":1788240194097,"end":1788240194098}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Wait — there's a problem with the fallback aliases now containing both `key` and `base` in the frozenset — but fallback clubs aren't in ALIAS_INDEX (they're created on demand), so that's just informational. But the ClubResolver in loaders caches raw_name → club. Different raw names (\"Luverdense - MT\" and \"Luverdense\") → both fallback → SAME club_id \"x_luverdense\" ✓ (the id is derived from base). The two cache entries are different Club objects with equal ids — fine since identity is by club_id. The `self.clubs.setdefault(club.club_id, club)` in engine keeps the first one.\n\nNow — the engine's `_dedupe` rewrite. Replace the whole dedup + standings logic:\n\n1. `PREFERRED_SOURCES` dict.\n2. New `_dedupe` with pairing-merge.\n3. `_standings_source` removed — standings uses `_by_family_season` directly (dedup already made source authoritative).\n4. CBF tiebreaker: (-points, -wins, -gd, -gf).\n5. Track `self.dropped_rows` count for a data-quality report.\n\nAlso `_dedupe` needs the \"no preferred present\" branch with exact-date dedup — but now with base-key fallback, BRF cup 2022/23 rows are unique by (date, pairing) anyway.\n\nLet me rewrite those parts of engine.py.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05b6be172001ENyyiQWnZ5mwkD","sessionID":"ses_fa4a24ca1ffeh7JKx4QpKQV4BC","messageID":"msg_05b6bcf82001FMtwZYqj8GG1sF"}}
